    {
      "topic": "Public C17 original",
      "result": "REAUTHORIZATION_PRESERVED_AND_STRENGTHENED",
      "detail": "Public memory.readOriginal opens the complete current case and canonical records linked to the captured digest, resolves every linked dependency, requires fresh/historical authorized projections, compares capture/ref/record integrity, rereads current case and sources, recaptures the original, then compares Atlas partition/outbox/case/product state and all three source fences before returning a cloned reference. It does not rewrite historical projection bytes."
